  "prefLabel": "Res 8403.05 Authorized Trail Administrator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 8403.05 Authorized Trail Administrator. Each OHRV club, snowmobile club and political subdivision requesting grant-in-aid shall authorize a trail administrator to represent their organization and shall complete and submit the signature page of the Grant In Aid Application Form 8405.01, 8405.02 or 8405.03, 2015 Version, as applicable. The trail administrator’s name shall be listed on the application.\n\nSource. #9350, eff 12-24-08; ss by #10850, eff 6-17-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res8100-8500.html"
